Incident Response Automation with Python
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Build automated log collection and analysis systems using Python
Implement severity-based incident response workflows
Create automated alerting mechanisms for security events
Develop scripts for threat detection and pattern matching
Configure automated response actions based on incident severity
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

Basic Python programming knowledge (functions, file I/O, regular expressions)
Familiarity with Linux command line and log file structures
Understanding of basic cybersecurity concepts and incident response principles
