Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Permission denied when running scripts

Solution: Ensure scripts are executable with chmod +x script_name.py
Check file ownership: ls -l scripts/
Issue: Module import errors

Solution: Verify directory structure matches expected paths
Check Python path includes script directories
Use absolute imports or adjust sys.path
Issue: No incidents detected

Solution: Verify sample log files exist in logs/ subdirectories
Check regex patterns match log format
Print log content to debug pattern matching
Issue: iptables commands fail

Solution: Requires sudo privileges (may not work in restricted environments)
For testing, simulate blocking by logging action instead of executing command
Check if iptables is installed: which iptables
